  "summary": [
    "Model boundary: logical identity, relations, versions and sources of truth; current files and the last confirmed index are separate information",
    "Entity table: document identity, index target specification, observations, document information, reference description, check result, section entry, final check state, confirmed ToC, build run",
    "Document information is stored once per doc_link_id and shared by all keys, never copied per key",
    "AI-generated fields have an ungenerated state when the search backend is doc-db",
    "Multiplicity: one document in many keys, many references per document, at most one confirmed ToC per key",
    "Section identification by DLID at heading-line ends; no heading text as permanent ID",
    "Value meaning and freshness: document ID versus content hash, reference check results valid only for the checked directory and time",
    "Documents leaving the index target are removed from the confirmed ToC without searching outside scope"
  ],
